 "remarks": "Enjoy the best of New Canaan living from this stunning new construction home, tucked along a quiet private lane yet just a short walk to schools, town, train and park. Set on a beautifully landscaped .57-acre property, the expansive, flat backyard-with pool and spa-is a true rarity this close to town. Designed for effortless everyday living and entertaining, the main level centers around a chef's kitchen with quartzite countertops, Thermador appliances, an oversized island and light-filled breakfast area, flowing into the family room and out to covered outdoor living, granite patio and summer kitchen. A butler's pantry/bar serves the formal dining room and living spaces, making entertaining easy. More than 6,700 square feet across four levels offers room for everyone, including a flexible office/guest suite, primary retreat with radiant-heated spa bath, three en-suite bedrooms, third-floor bedroom and lounge with full bath, and lower level with space for fitness, play, sauna and a guest or au-pair suite. Walk to town, spend summer days by the pool and enjoy exceptional space and privacy-all with the ease of in-town living. Ready for move-in by mid-October!",
